  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, garlic, and ginger and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 minutes or until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the che ba mau in a molcajete.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
